{"3123540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lover's Enigma", "steam_appid": 3123540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/2e15d2304a38a706723746566e9b1a92.avif?t=1781509980\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1781509980\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.mp4?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.poster.avif?t=1781509980\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.webm?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.mp4?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Miyuki, a woman in her late 20s whose new marriage is shattered by the sudden, mysterious death of her husband. As you search for the truth, you’ll navigate love, loss, and the shadows of a dangerous cult—making choices that could heal or break you. Along the way, you’ll meet 4 unique male leads, each connected to Miyuki in a deeply personal way. Some may protect you, some may deceive you, and some might blur the line between the two. Beyond entertainment, Lover’s Enigma also raises awareness of emotional well-being and trauma recovery, woven naturally into its narrative. It’s not just a story you play—it’s an experience that reflects on resilience in the face of grief.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/e883f9e758750943c41b300ffb85113f.avif?t=1781509980\" width=620 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/7cb7b1f5734f3e43b8dd93d5af4f34b3.avif?t=1781509980\" width=620 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 Male Leads you will meet over the course of the game. Each one of them connects to you in some way or another. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1781509980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1781509980 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1781509980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1781509980 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1781509980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1781509980 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1781509980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1781509980 width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/8517f7b9383beec390d9628c0b5bc407.avif?t=1781509980\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tantalizing tale of trauma and torment will include at minimum:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 200,000+ words  <br>💘 4 Contrasting Love Interests<br>💒 Multiple endings (both good and bad!) <br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.poster.avif?t=1781509980\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.webm?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.mp4?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your choices shape their perception of you. Get to know each of the male leads on a deeper level... or push them away. The choice is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative with over 10 different endings shaped by your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your actions, the story will be influenced in a certain way that either gives you a happy ending or results in the cult getting their hands on you. Outcomes range from bittersweet romance to chilling tragedy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of static and fully animated CGs as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different animated CGs as you delve more into the world of Lover's Enigma. Fully animated CGs for you to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm mini-game that helps restore sanity—symbolizing small acts of self-care amidst chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to solve mysteries can be tiring. To relax, you often turn to your phone for games in order to keep calm. Successfully completing these increases your sanity, allowing you to get through another day. There are multiple difficulties, with each harder difficulty you successfully complete, the more your sanity stays.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.poster.avif?t=1781509980\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.webm?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.mp4?t=1781509980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312354